#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strlen>()  function calculates the length of the string pointed to "
#| "by I<s>, excluding the terminating null byte (\\[aq]\\e0\\[aq])."
msgid ""
"The B<strlen>()  function calculates the length of the string pointed to by "
"I<s>, excluding the terminating null byte (\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq])."
msgstr ""
"La fonction B<strlen>() calcule la longueur de la chaîne de caractères "
"pointée par I<s>, sans compter l'octet NULL final («\\ \\e0\\ »)."

